 "description": "The new Swift Trawler 43 Sedan introduces a fresh approach to family cruising, offering more space, greater comfort, and more opportunities to enjoy life on the water. Faithful to Swift Trawler DNA, it combines autonomy, safety, and exceptional onboard comfort in a thoughtfully designed cruiser that invites owners to extend every moment at sea.",
