   "kind": "interior-design",
   "id": null,
   "title": "Interior Design",
   "intro": "On board, the Swift Trawler 43 Sedan embraces a more residential approach to cruising, combining generous living spaces, premium materials, and ergonomics thoughtfully designed for extended stays on the water.\nThe enlarged galley, featuring a Corian® countertop, delivers enhanced functionality and increased storage capacity, while the saloon creates a warm and contemporary setting for sharing time together. Expansive glazing throughout the saloon reinforces the sense of openness and strengthens the connection with the surrounding seascape.\nThe accommodation spaces are designed with privacy and wellbeing in mind, featuring an inviting owner’s cabin, a comfortable guest cabin, and bathrooms equipped with true separate shower stalls. The portside guest cabin also benefits from direct access to the day head via a practical Jack & Jill arrangement, enhancing both comfort and convenience on board.\nFor an even more sophisticated onboard experience, the Luxe Pack introduces elevated finishes and refined detailing, creating a warm and elegant atmosphere throughout the boat.",
